OneTimeUseIdPolicy::consumeFor
├── given checkAction validated the caller's consumeFor in this transaction
│   └── it should execute (the validation already burned and nominated)
├── given no validation preceded it
│   └── it should revert with BurnNotValidated, spending and nominating nothing
├── given it executes with a witness other than the validated one
│   └── it should not change the nomination
├── given a stranger calls with the account's id
│   └── it should revert with BurnNotValidated
└── given the caller's validation named a different id
    └── it should revert with BurnNotValidated
